# Alerts sheet status discipline

When updating the workflow Alerts Google Sheet
(`1N9Zlc1SaumhfcxT8biXCBhmfeuBg5p8s` / gid `1306124640`):

1. Scope **Category = Alerts** unless the user asks otherwise.
2. If **Status** is set to **Done**, Notes must **not** contain
   `NEED TEST` / `need test`. Strip those phrases; use a short closed/shipped note.
3. Apply the same cleanup to any existing **Done** rows that still say NEED TEST in Notes.
4. Prefer Playwright sheet helpers when clasp OAuth lacks Sheets API enablement.
